Class ErrorType:
- distinguish domain_error, integration_error, and api_error

Class ErrorDetail:
- serialize machine-readable error metadata

Class ErrorResponse:
- include ErrorDetail plus request_id

Class AppError:
- shared base class for intentional app exceptions

Class DomainError:
- 400-level domain validation failures

Class IntegrationError:
- 502-style downstream/storage/provider failures

Class ApiError:
- generic request/contract errors

Function _request_id_from_request:
- pull request_id from Request.state or contextvar fallback

Function _build_error_response:
- build JSONResponse payload and mirror X-Request-ID header

Function register_exception_handlers:
- install handlers for AppError, RequestValidationError, and unexpected Exception
